  "appeal_decision": null,
  "description": "This Design, Access supports a revised planning application for the installation of two air conditioning condenser units at roof level serving Flat 3 at 81 Duke Street. The application addresses the reasons for refusal of the previous proposal and presents an amended scheme that significantly reduces visual and heritage impact. The new proposal positions the condensers side-by-side in a low-profile arrangement, concealed from view behind the chimney stack. Planting will be introduced around the units to further reduce visibility. The revised scheme is discreet and does not result in visual harm or material alteration to the historic fabric.",
